.TH "SOPLOS-LOOK-MANAGER" "1" "2026-11-16" "Soplos Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soplos-look-manager \- theme and layout manager for Soplos Linux Tyson (Plasma)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soplos-look-manager
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soplos-look-manager
changes how Soplos Linux Tyson looks and behaves from a graphical interface.
Built with Tauri 2, Rust and Svelte, its pages are in four groups:
.IP \[bu] 2
.B Look:
global themes of Plasma, with a preview, applied with the choice of what to
apply (the appearance, and the layout of the desktop and the panels); color
schemes; the style of the applications and of Plasma; window decorations
(KWin plugins and Aurorae themes); sounds; icon, cursor and GTK themes.
.IP \[bu]
.B Desktop:
wallpapers of the system and of the user, and the panels: adding and removing
them, their position, height, style (classic, dock and side bar), alignment,
width, offset, opacity and hiding, and the elements on them.
.IP \[bu]
.B Windows:
virtual desktops, window behavior (focus, placement, snapping and mouse
actions), window rules, desktop effects, KWin scripts and the task switcher.
.IP \[bu]
.B Start-up:
start-up screens and the picture of the login screen of Plasma Login Manager.
.P
What the pages list can be installed from the store of KDE or from a file,
and removed.
.P
The window never runs as root. The change of the login screen goes through a
single Polkit-gated helper, authenticated with
.BR pkexec (1),
which accepts only a closed list of operations and checks every value before
it writes.
.P
The interface is available in English, Spanish, German, French, Italian,
Portuguese, Romanian and Russian. It starts in the system language and falls
back to English. The light or dark theme of the window follows the one of
Plasma.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-run-ops \fIFILE\fR
Internal Polkit-authenticated task: validate and run the operations stored in
.IR FILE .
Used by the application itself through
.BR pkexec (1)
and not meant to be called by hand.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B F1
About dialog.
.TP
.B Ctrl+1 \fRto\fB Ctrl+9
The first nine pages.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Tab
Next page.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+Tab
Previous page.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit the application.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/soplos-look-manager/
Small copies of the wallpapers and the pictures of the icon and cursor themes,
made once so the pages show quickly.
.TP
.I /etc/plasmalogin.conf
The settings of the login screen of Plasma Login Manager.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/soplos-look-manager/soplos-look-manager-style-preview
Helper that draws the preview of the application styles and window decorations.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.soplos.lookmanager.policy
Polkit policy defining the administrator privileges for the login screen.
